      "writtenOn": "2022-01-29T05:13:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I filed b/216893756 as I couldn\u0027t find any existing bug.\n\nUnderstood the goal to migrate to the Zephyr APIs. The EC-OS ways need to be moved away. Just curious how to handle the the interrupt which is handled in the driver, so no \"cros-ec,gpio-interrupts\" node, e.g. the RTC pin. As the \"cros-ec,gpio-interrupts\" node is expected to be deprecated in the future. More and more interrupts will be moved to the driver.",
